{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2050,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the word atom means uncuttable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5230,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the Greeks were thinking of it as a tiny hard\nsphere\nPhil: that's right\nDerek: and even up until the eighteen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10110,
    "dDurationMs": 4569,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hundred's that was the idea of an atom, the\nsmallest piece of matter, a tiny hard sphere"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14679,
    "dDurationMs": 2571,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then we find out that that's not quite\nright"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17250,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not quite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18420,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there were experiments in the eighteen hundreds\nthat discovered the electron, JJ Thomson's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23320,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experiments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24660,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really worked out the electron was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26910,
    "dDurationMs": 5750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "smaller than an atom, about 1000\ntimes smaller than a hydrogen atom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32660,
    "dDurationMs": 550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was in all atoms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33210,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's right, not just hydrogen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36150,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whatever material he did his experiments on\nhe found there was electrons in them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39780,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are electrons in an all atoms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41830,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I guess when you find something smaller than an atom\nyou need to propose a new model for the atom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46190,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that actually has something smaller in it some\nsubstructure\nPhil: that's right so something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50430,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51470,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is our model of the atom\nPhil: This is our model of the atom -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54280,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in his day, it was known as the plum pudding\nmodel but uh... here we have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58740,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cherry tart\nPhil: cherry tart, ok so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61060,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the idea being that we have an overall atom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64310,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "usually pictured as spherical rather than 2D but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67620,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "uh... but imbedded within it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69770,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is the important part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70830,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are negative electrons represented by\ncherries and they can come out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76650,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the overall atom is neutral, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80020,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that means that pudding part must be positive\nDerek: now how would you get one of these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84410,
    "dDurationMs": 850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "electrons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85260,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out of our pudding here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87070,
    "dDurationMs": 5950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so electrons are negatively charged so we'll need\nto put something very positive which attracts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93020,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "electrons, a high voltage\nDerek: and that would have\nthe effect of say like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96850,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "plucking a cherry out of the pudding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100300,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's pretty much it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103310,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yeah you could do it kind of like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106670,
    "dDurationMs": 1259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we're simulating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107929,
    "dDurationMs": 1151,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what it would be like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109080,
    "dDurationMs": 5390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to put a positive charge up here.\nPhil: that's right, that's right\nDerek: pulling the electrons out of the atom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114470,
    "dDurationMs": 1039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's quite a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115509,
    "dDurationMs": 3171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "delicious\nPhil: Yeah!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118680,
    "dDurationMs": 3049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well that is the most delicious model of the atom,\nI've gotta say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121729,
    "dDurationMs": 2051,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so shall we uh split the atom?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123780,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why don't you go ahead\nPhil: you want me to do it? \nDerek: yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127090,
    "dDurationMs": 4349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Who knows what could happen,\na whole bunch of energy could be released.\nPhil: Yeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131439,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one, two, three..."
    } ]
  } ]
}
